{"seq":3,"slug":"asr-customization","title":"ASR 定制化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/production/asr-customization","wordCount":1845,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"asr-定制化技术\">ASR 定制化技术</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>热词 Boosting</strong>：在解码时提升特定词汇的输出概率，无需重训模型，是最轻量的定制手段</li>\n<li><strong>Contextual Biasing</strong>：通过 bias encoder 和交叉注意力让模型在注意力层面直接感知上下文词汇</li>\n<li><strong>Adapter/LoRA 微调</strong>：在模型层间插入少量可训练参数实现领域适配，保持通用能力不退化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"领域定制的必要性\">领域定制的必要性</h2><p>通用 ASR 模型在开放域表现优异，但面对特定领域时仍存在明显短板。医疗场景中的&quot;甲氨蝶呤&quot;、&quot;左旋多巴&quot;，法律场景中的&quot;不可抗力条款&quot;、&quot;善意取得&quot;，金融场景中的&quot;可转债&quot;、&quot;量化对冲&quot;——这些低频专业术语在通用训练数据中出现极少，导致识别错误率显著高于日常用语。</p>\n<p>定制化的核心目标是：在不破坏模型通用能力的前提下，提升特定领域/场景的识别精度。这涉及三个层面的技术：语言模型层面的热词和上下文偏置、声学模型层面的领域微调、以及工程层面的后处理修正。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[通用 ASR 模型] --&gt; B{定制化需求}&#10;    B --&gt; C[解码层定制]&#10;    B --&gt; D[模型层定制]&#10;    B --&gt; E[后处理层定制]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[热词 Boosting]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[Contextual Biasing]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[领域 LM 融合]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[领域数据微调]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[Adapter 适配]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[Prompt Tuning]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[文本后处理/ITN]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[纠错模型]&#10;    E --&gt; E3[实体替换]\">graph TD\n    A[通用 ASR 模型] --&gt; B{定制化需求}\n    B --&gt; C[解码层定制]\n    B --&gt; D[模型层定制]\n    B --&gt; E[后处理层定制]\n    C --&gt; C1[热词 Boosting]\n    C --&gt; C2[Contextual Biasing]\n    C --&gt; C3[领域 LM 融合]\n    D --&gt; D1[领域数据微调]\n    D --&gt; D2[Adapter 适配]\n    D --&gt; D3[Prompt Tuning]\n    E --&gt; E1[文本后处理/ITN]\n    E --&gt; E2[纠错模型]\n    E --&gt; E3[实体替换]</pre><h2 id=\"热词提升与上下文偏置\">热词提升与上下文偏置</h2><p><strong>热词 Boosting</strong> 是最轻量的定制手段——在解码时提升特定词汇的输出概率，无需重训模型：</p>\n<p><strong>n-gram boosting</strong>：在 WFST 解码图中为热词路径增加固定分数奖励。实现简单，支持运行时动态更新。但对于 BPE/char 等子词建模单元，热词需要被拆分为子词序列并在解码路径中正确匹配。</p>\n<p><strong>Shallow Fusion boosting</strong>：在 beam search 过程中，当部分假设与热词前缀匹配时增加得分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn mathvariant=\"double-struck\">1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mtext> matches hotword prefix</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(y_t) = \\log P(y_t|y_{&lt;t}, X) + \\beta \\cdot \\mathbb{1}[y_{\\leq t} \\text{ matches hotword prefix}]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1774em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2952em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mrel mtight\">≤</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2452em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> matches hotword prefix</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n<th>过高风险</th>\n<th>过低风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>boost 分数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>2.0-8.0</td>\n<td>强制输出不相关热词</td>\n<td>效果不明显</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>热词列表大小</td>\n<td>10-500</td>\n<td>搜索空间膨胀</td>\n<td>覆盖不足</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前缀匹配长度</td>\n<td>完整匹配</td>\n<td>计算开销</td>\n<td>短前缀误激活</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Contextual Biasing（上下文偏置）</strong>：更高级的方法是让模型在注意力层面直接感知上下文词汇。通过额外的 bias encoder 将热词列表编码为向量序列，主模型的解码器通过交叉注意力动态关注相关热词：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mtext>CrossAttention</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>BiasEncoder</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>hotwords</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_t^{bias} = \\text{CrossAttention}(s_t, \\text{BiasEncoder}(\\text{hotwords}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1461em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">bia</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CrossAttention</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BiasEncoder</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">hotwords</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这种深度集成比简单的分数 boost 更精确——模型可以根据声学证据和语义上下文判断何时激活哪个热词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"领域语言模型融合\">领域语言模型融合</h2><p>为特定领域构建强化的语言模型，通过 fusion 策略与通用 ASR 模型结合：</p>\n<p><strong>Shallow Fusion</strong>：解码时线性插值外部 LM 分数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log P(y|X) + \\lambda \\log P_{domain}(y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">main</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>Deep Fusion</strong>：将外部 LM 的隐状态与解码器隐状态拼接后通过门控网络融合。需要联合训练，但效果更好。</p>\n<p><strong>Cold Fusion</strong>：预训练 LM 固定，ASR 模型学习&quot;何时信任 LM&quot;的门控。</p>\n<p><strong>ILME（Internal LM Estimation）</strong>：估计 E2E 模型内部隐式 LM 的贡献，然后减去内部 LM、加上外部领域 LM：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log P(y|X) - \\lambda_1 \\log P_{internal}(y) + \\lambda_2 \\log P_{domain}(y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">main</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[ASR 编码器] --&gt; B[解码器]&#10;    B --&gt; C[ASR 得分]&#10;    D[领域 LM] --&gt; E[LM 得分]&#10;    F[内部 LM 估计] --&gt; G[ILM 得分]&#10;    C --&gt; H[融合]&#10;    E --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; H&#10;    H --&gt; I[最终输出]\">graph LR\n    A[ASR 编码器] --&gt; B[解码器]\n    B --&gt; C[ASR 得分]\n    D[领域 LM] --&gt; E[LM 得分]\n    F[内部 LM 估计] --&gt; G[ILM 得分]\n    C --&gt; H[融合]\n    E --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; H\n    H --&gt; I[最终输出]</pre><p>实践中的领域 LM 构建：收集目标领域的文本数据（医疗报告、法律文书、客服对话记录），训练 n-gram 或小型 Transformer LM。文本数据获取成本远低于配对音频-文本数据，这使得 LM fusion 成为性价比最高的定制手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型微调与适配\">模型微调与适配</h2><p>当热词和 LM fusion 不足以满足精度要求时，需要对模型本身进行适配：</p>\n<p><strong>全参数微调（Full Fine-tuning）</strong>：使用领域配对数据（音频+转录）端到端微调整个模型。效果最好但风险最大——过多的领域数据会导致通用能力退化（catastrophic forgetting）。缓解策略包括：混入通用数据保持比例、使用较小学习率、早停。</p>\n<p><strong>Adapter 微调</strong>：在 Conformer 层间插入 bottleneck adapter（典型 bottleneck 维度 64-256），仅训练 adapter 参数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>h</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>ReLU</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h&#x27; = h + f_{adapter}(h) = h + W_{up} \\cdot \\text{ReLU}(W_{down} \\cdot h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ReLU</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>参数增量仅 2-5%，但可达到全参数微调 80-90% 的效果。多个领域可共存——每个领域训练独立的 adapter，推理时按需加载。</p>\n<p><strong>LoRA（Low-Rank Adaptation）</strong>：对注意力权重矩阵施加低秩更新 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta W = BA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d \\times r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A \\in \\mathbb{R}^{r \\times d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\ll d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>），参数增量更小（&lt;1%）。2026 年在语音模型微调中已广泛使用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>参数增量</th>\n<th>训练数据需求</th>\n<th>通用能力保持</th>\n<th>多领域并存</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Full Fine-tune</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>&gt;100h</td>\n<td>需混合训练</td>\n<td>困难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adapter</td>\n<td>2-5%</td>\n<td>10-50h</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>容易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LoRA</td>\n<td>&lt;1%</td>\n<td>5-20h</td>\n<td>很好</td>\n<td>容易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Prompt Tuning</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1%</td>\n<td>5-10h</td>\n<td>最好</td>\n<td>非常容易</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"文本后处理-inverse-text-normalization\">文本后处理（Inverse Text Normalization）</h2><p>ASR 模型输出的原始文本通常是全小写无标点的&quot;spoken form&quot;，需要后处理转换为可读的&quot;written form&quot;：</p>\n<p><strong>ITN（Inverse Text Normalization）</strong> 处理以下转换：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数字：&quot;一百二十三&quot; → &quot;123&quot;</li>\n<li>日期：&quot;二零二六年七月四日&quot; → &quot;2026年7月4日&quot;</li>\n<li>时间：&quot;下午三点半&quot; → &quot;15:30&quot;</li>\n<li>货币：&quot;三百五十美元&quot; → &quot;$350&quot;</li>\n<li>地址/电话等实体格式化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>标点恢复（Punctuation Restoration）</strong>：使用独立的序列标注模型（通常基于 BERT/RoBERTa）为 ASR 输出添加标点符号。输入为 ASR 文本 token 序列，输出为每个 token 后的标点标签（无/逗号/句号/问号等）。</p>\n<p><strong>大小写恢复（Truecasing）</strong>：根据上下文判断哪些词需要大写——专有名词、句首、缩写等。</p>\n<p><strong>领域实体修正</strong>：基于领域知识库的 fuzzy matching，将识别错误的实体名纠正为标准形式。例如将&quot;阿奇霉素&quot;的误识结果&quot;阿七霉素&quot;通过编辑距离匹配修正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定制化的评估与迭代\">定制化的评估与迭代</h2><p>定制效果的评估不应仅看整体 WER，还需关注：</p>\n<p><strong>术语召回率（Term Recall）</strong>：目标热词被正确识别的比例。可能整体 WER 改善不大，但关键术语的识别率从 60% 提升到 95% 对业务意义重大。</p>\n<p><strong>误触发率（False Activation Rate）</strong>：热词 boost 过高可能导致在非目标上下文中错误输出热词。</p>\n<p><strong>A/B 测试</strong>：在真实流量中对比定制前后的模型，观察下游任务（如客服意图分类准确率、医疗记录完整性）的实际改善。</p>\n<p>定制化是一个持续迭代过程：收集真实场景的 bad case → 分析错误模式（是声学问题还是语言模型问题）→ 选择对应的定制手段 → 评估效果 → 持续积累数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>ASR 定制化是一个从轻量到重量的技术谱系：热词 boosting 无需训练即可部署；领域 LM fusion 需要文本数据但不需配对音频；adapter/LoRA 微调需要少量配对数据；全参数微调效果最好但风险最大。选择哪种方案取决于可用数据量、精度要求和维护成本的权衡。文本后处理（ITN、标点恢复、实体修正）作为定制化的最后一环，对最终可读性和下游应用质量同样关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"streaming-asr\">流式语音识别系统</a> 介绍定制化技术在流式场景下的额外约束和实现考量。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ASR 定制化技术","id":"asr-定制化技术"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"领域定制的必要性","id":"领域定制的必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"热词提升与上下文偏置","id":"热词提升与上下文偏置"},{"level":2,"text":"领域语言模型融合","id":"领域语言模型融合"},{"level":2,"text":"模型微调与适配","id":"模型微调与适配"},{"level":2,"text":"文本后处理（Inverse Text Normalization）","id":"文本后处理-inverse-text-normalization"},{"level":2,"text":"定制化的评估与迭代","id":"定制化的评估与迭代"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"多语言与口音适配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/production/multilingual-accent"},"next":{"title":"ASR 评测指标与基准数据集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/speech-recognition-asr/evaluation-frontier/asr-metrics-benchmarks"}}